s  \n    47|\n    48|**Mapped FRs:** [FR-002]  \n    49|**Dependencies:** EPIC-001, EPIC-002  \n    50|**Acceptance Criteria:**\n    51|- All 7 topic pages accessible\n    52|- Content loads correctly on each page\n    53|- Navigation between topics functional\n    54|- Page-specific elements validated\n    55|\n    56|---\n    57|\n    58|### EPIC-004: Top Navigation Menu Testing\n    59|**Title:** Top Navigation \"Inside FIFA\" Menu Validation  \n    60|**Priority Tier:** Must Have  \n    61|**Complexity:** Medium  \n    62|**Description:** Test the top navigation bar \"Inside FIFA\" button and all sub-menu items  \n    63|\n    64|**Mapped FRs:** [FR-003]  \n    65|**Dependencies:** EPIC-001  \n    66|**Acceptance Criteria:**\n    67|- \"Inside FIFA\" button accessible\n    68|- All sub-items discovered and testable\n    69|- Dropdown/click functionality working\n    70|- Sub-item navigation validated\n    71|\n    72|---\n    73|\n    74|### EPIC-005: Multi-language Framework Support\n    75|**Title:** Multi-language Testing Capability  \n    76|**Priority Tier:** Should Have  \n    77|**Complexity:** High  \n    78|**Description:** Extend framework to support testing across multiple languages (EN, ES, FR)  \n    79|\n    80|**Mapped FRs:** [FR-004]  \n    81|**Dependencies:** EPIC-001, EPIC-002, EPIC-003, EPIC-004  \n    82|**Acceptance Criteria:**\n    83|- Language switching mechanism implemented\n    84|- English version fully tested\n    85|- Spanish and French versions testable\n    86|- Language-specific selectors managed\n    87|\n    88|---\n    89|\n    90|### EPIC-006: Cross-browser Expansion\n    91|**Title:** Cross-browser Testing Extension  \n    92|**Priority Tier:** Could Have  \n    93|**Complexity:** High  \n    94|**Description:** Extend test coverage to additional browsers beyond Chrome  \n    95|\n    96|**Mapped FRs:** [FR-005]  \n    97|**Dependencies:** EPIC-001  \n    98|**Acceptance Criteria:**\n    99|- Framework architecture supports 