 QR-005 | Page load performance degradation | Load time measurement with Playwright | complete | MTP |\n    29|| QR-006 | Test reliability below target | Pass rate monitoring and retry logic | complete | MTP |\n    30|| QR-007 | Test maintenance time exceeds target | POM pattern and externalized data | complete | MTP |\n    31|| QR-008 | Cross-platform compatibility issues | Desktop Chrome validation | complete | MTP |\n    32|| QR-009 | Website structure changes break tests | Robust selector strategies | complete | MTP |\n    33|| QR-010 | Rate limiting blocks test execution | Test delays and retry mechanisms | assumption | MTP |\n    34|| QR-011 | Content localization variations | Multi-language test configurations | assumption | MTP |\n    35|| QR-012 | Browser compatibility failures | Cross-browser expansion framework | pending | MTP |\n    36|\n    37|## tool_selections\n    38|unit_be_tools:\n    39|| tool | pros | cons | score | selected | source |\n    40||------|------|------|-------|----------|--------|\n    41|| jest | Lightweight, fast execution | Limited browser context | 7 | no | MTP |\n    42|| playwright_test | Native framework integration | Browser overhead for unit | 9 | yes | ADR-001 |\n    43|\n    44|unit_fe_tools:\n    45|| tool | pros | cons | score | selected | source |\n    46||------|------|------|-------|----------|--------|\n    47|| jest_dom | Fast component testing | No real browser | 6 | no | MTP |\n    48|| playwright_component | Real browser context | Slower than headless | 9 | yes | ADR-001 |\n    49|\n    50|api_integration_tools:\n    51|| tool | pros | cons | score | selected | source |\n    52||------|------|------|-------|----------|--------|\n    53|| supertest | Lightweight API testing | Node.js only | 7 | no | assumption |\n    54|| playwright_api | Unified framework | Limited API features | 8 | yes | ADR-001 |\n    55|\n    56|e2e_fe_tools:\n    57|| tool | pros | cons | score | selected | source |\n    58||------|------|------|-------|----------|--------|\n    59|| selenium | Mature, wide browser support | Complex setup, slower | 6 | no | assumption |\n    60|| playwright | Modern, fast, reliable | Newer ecosystem | 9 | yes | ADR-001 |\n    61|\n    62|performance_tools:\n    63|| tool | pros | cons | score | selected | source |\n    64||------|------|------|-------|----------|--------|\n    65|| lighthouse_ci | Comprehensive metrics | Google-focused | 7 | no | assumption |\n    66|| playwright_performance | Native integration | Limited metrics | 8 | yes | ADR-001 |\n    67|\n    68|sast_tools:\n    69|| tool | pros | cons | score | selected | source |\n    70||------|------|------|-------|----------|--------|\n    71|| eslint | Industry standard | False positives | 8 | yes | assumption |\n    72|| sonarqube | Comprehensive analysis | Complex setup | 6 | no | assumption |\n    73|\n    74|dast_tools:\n    75|| tool | pros | cons | score | selected | source |\n    76||------|------|------|-------|----------|--------|\n    77|| owasp_zap | Open source, comprehensive | Complex configuration | 6 | no | assumption |\n    78|| playwright_security | Integrated with framework | Limited security features | 7 | yes | assumption |\n    79|\n    80|contract_tools:\n    81|| tool | pros | cons | score | selected | source |\n    82||------|------|------|-------|----------|--------|\n    83|| pact | Consumer-driven contracts | Complex setup | 5 | no | assumption |\n    84|| playwright_validation | Simple validation | Limited contract features | 6 | yes | assumption |\n    85|\n    86|accessibility_tools:\n    87|| tool | pros | cons | score | selected | source |\n    88||------|------|------|-------|----------|--------|\n    89|| axe | Comprehensive accessibility | External dependency | 7 | yes | assumption |\n    90|| playwright_accessibility | Native support | Limited features | 6 | no | assumption |\n    91|\n    92|## pyramid_config\n    93|test_pyramid:\n    94|| level | percentage | tool | be